 presented the turkeys."], [48.72, "Nixon reportedly sent one bird to a petting zoo."], [51.8, "Unofficially."], [52.7, "Ronald Reagan spent Thanksgiving 1985 at his ranch."], [56.17, "A pilot flew over it with a 120-foot banner: \"Happy Thanksgiving Ron and Nancy.\""], [61.55, "Then, 1987."], [63.25, "A reporter asked Reagan whether he would pardon officials in the Iran-Contra affair."], [68.33, "Reagan deflected with a joke about the turkey: \"If they'd given me a different answer on Charlie and his future, I would have pardoned him.\""], [74.91, "Charlie was already headed to a petting zoo."], [77.33, "The word \"pardon\" was now attached to a turkey."], [80.16, "As a joke."], [81.21, "Two years later, it stopped being a joke."], [83.52, "Thirteen. George H.W. Bush. It'S Official."], [85.61, "November 17th, 1989."], [88.33, "Two hundred years after Washington's first proclamation."], [91.7, "George H.W."], [92.79, "Bush stands in front of a turkey and says it \"will not end up on anyone's dinner table.\""], [97.37, "Then: \"He's granted a presidential pardon as of right now.\""], [100.4, "And he sent the turkey to live out its days on a children's farm."], [103.77, "That's the moment the official, every-year pardon begins."], [107.43, "Scoreboard: Turkeys spared, with no asterisk: one."], [111.19, "Finally."]], "words": [["john", 0, 0.0], ["f", 0, 0.29], ["kennedy", 0, 0.4], ["let", 0, 0.8], ["this", 0, 0.99], ["one", 0, 1.15], ["grow", 0, 1.31], ["november", 1, 1.59], ["19th", 1, 2.02], ["1963", 1, 2.52], ["kennedy", 2, 4.03], ["is", 2, 4.45], ["presented", 2, 4.56], ["with", 2, 4.97], ["a", 2, 5.11], ["large", 2, 5.14], ["white", 2, 5.71], ["turkey", 2, 6.19], ["around", 2, 6.68], ["55", 2, 7.13], ["pounds", 2, 7.68], ["it", 3, 8.49], ["wears", 3, 8.64], ["a", 3, 8.94], ["sign", 3, 8.99], ["good", 3, 9.68], ["eating", 3, 9.9], ["mr", 3, 10.5], ["president", 4, 11.09], ["kennedy", 5, 11.88], ["looks", 5, 12.25], ["at", 5, 12.56], ["it", 5, 12.7], ["and", 5, 12.8